rovide a mechanism for accounts to lose their privileges if they are compromised (such as when a trusted device is misplaced). If the calling account had been granted `role`, emits a {RoleRevoked} event. Requirements: - the caller must be `account`."},"revokeRole(bytes32,address)":{"details":"Revokes `role` from `account`. If `account` had been granted `role`, emits a {RoleRevoked} event. Requirements: - the caller must have ``role``'s admin role."},"stake(address,uint256)":{"params":{"_amount":"amount to stake","_stakeToken":"a specified stake token to be staked"}},"stakeNFT(address,address,uint256)":{"details":"This one is a preparation for nft staking info, if nft address and nft token id are the same with existing record, it will be reverted","params":{"_nftAddress":"composite key for nft","_nftTokenId":"composite key for nft","_stakeToken":"a specified stake token address"}},"transferOwnership(address)":{"details":"Transfers ownership of the contract to a new account (`newOwner`). Can only be called by the current owner."},"unpause()":{"details":"Only possible when contract is paused."},"unstake(address,uint256)":{"details":"function for unstaking a stakeToken and receive some rewards","params":{"_amount":"amount to stake","_stakeToken":"a specified stake token to be unstaked"}},"unstakeAll(address)":{"details":"similar to unstake with user's shares","params":{"_stakeToken":"a specified stake token to be unstaked"}},"unstakeNFT(address)":{"details":"This one is a preparation for nft staking info, if nft address and nft token id are the same with existing record, it will be reverted","params":{"_stakeToken":"a specified stake token address"}}},"version":1},"userdoc":{"kind":"user","methods":{"emergencyWithdraw(address)":{"notice":"Withdraws a stake token from MasterBarista back to the user considerless the rewards."},"harvest(address)":{"notice":"function for harvesting the reward"},"harvest(address[])":{"notice":"function for harvesting rewards in specified sta